<ui-header title="十大热帖" back/><view class="page"><view class="notice hot-explain">近 7 天 · 点赞优先，同赞按评论数排序</view><button class="ranking-row" wx:for="{{posts}}" wx:key="id" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="openRow"><view class="ranking-copy"><view class="ranking-title">{{index + 1 < 10 ? '0' : ''}}{{index + 1}} {{item.body || '图片分享'}}</view><view class="muted">{{item.likeCount}} 赞 · {{item.commentCount}} 评论</view></view><image class="rank-chevron" src="/assets/ui/right-green.png"/></button><view-state state="{{state}}" message="{{state === 'empty' ? '近7天暂无公开帖子' : message}}" bind:retry="load"/></view>
